abel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:201608","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"わりと営業さん","creatorId":"egs:creator:33071","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:33071","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:33071","name":"わりと営業さん","detail":"営業・広報","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:201609","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"ホームラン","creatorId":"vndb:s34453","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s34453","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s34453","name":"ホームラン","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144122","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c64636","characterName":"美山 咲良","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67144","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17494"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64636"},"originalCharacterName":"美山 咲良","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">High School Student"},{"spoiler":false,"text":">The successor of the Miyama Retreat Onsen Inn"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high school student of firm character. Sakura helped out in the Iwamuro Village's famous onsen inn since she was young and thinks of succeeding the inn in the future. She helps her mother, who is the current \"okami\", as the young okami while attending school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Every year, the number of customers of the inn decreases and at this rate, the inn will go out of business. At such time, her father was hospitalized due to anxiety, so her mother is running the inn while taking care of him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While helping out her mother, Sakura looks for anything she can do to improve the situation of the inn and the village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Iwamuro Village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64636"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり者の女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧岩室村にある名門旅館・美山庵を子供の頃から手伝い、将来は旅館を継ぎたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は母親が女将で、咲良は学園へ通いながら手伝っている「若女将」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年々宿泊客が減少傾向にあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"このままでは潰れてしまうかもしれない状況に陥っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、日頃の心労が重なり、父が入院してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母は父の面倒を見ながら旅館業務を行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母を助けながら、何かもっと自分に出来る事は無いかと模索している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17494","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり者の女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧岩室村にある名門旅館・美山庵を子供の頃から手伝い、将来は旅館を継ぎたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は母親が女将で、咲良は学園へ通いながら手伝っている「若女将」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年々宿泊客が減少傾向にあり、このままでは潰れてしまうかもしれない状況に陥っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、日頃の心労が重なり、父が入院してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母は父の面倒を見ながら旅館業務を行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母を助けながら、何かもっと自分に出来る事は無いかと模索している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「美山庵はとってもいい旅館なんです。みなさんも是非泊まりに来てくださいね！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67144"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d10c4e4396b0edbdaeed5c45ad1b871eaa51afc57dc7ef14ac4a7973e36f866.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/1854572fcc360fa64b5782f28005606504380bc4835d2ff93e0bd7c4e1b6edab.webp","width":144,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水野七海","creatorId":"vndb:s2524","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2524","name":"星野七海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:227352:67144:17078:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64637","characterName":"生方 瑞穂","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67145","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17495"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64637"},"originalCharacterName":"生方 瑞穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">Nurse"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A nurse working in a clinic located at Iwamuro Village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She used to work in a big hospital in a large city, but wanting to work at a regional clinic where she can get closer to patients, she moved to this village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mizuho has a gentle and dedicated personality, and thanks to which she has already blended in among the locals. She is capable of following anyone's conversation whether they are young or old and is loved by all. One of the things she's great at is massage, and when elderly people come to the clinic she often massages their shoulders which they greatly enjoy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since it's hard to say that the clinic can respond to the needs of the village, she would like to improve its facilities and equipment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Iwamuro Village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64637"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧岩室村にある小さな診察所に勤めている看護師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて都会の大病院に勤めていたが、地域に密着した医療に関わりたいと、この地にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく献身的な性格で、今ではすっかり地元の一員として溶け込み、老若男女問わず、誰とでも話を合わせる事ができて、みんなから慕われれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マッサージが得意で、よく診察待ちの年輩の方々の肩を揉んだりしては喜ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現状、なかなか医療が行き届いているとは言えないため、もっと医療環境の充実を願っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17495","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧岩室村にある小さな診療所に勤めている看護師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて都会の大病院に勤めていたが、地域に密着した医療に関わりたいと、この地にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく献身的な性格で、今ではすっかり地元の一員として溶け込み、老若男女問わず、誰とでも話を合わせる事ができて、みんなから慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マッサージが得意で、よく診察待ちの年配の方々の肩を揉んだりしては喜ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現状、なかなか医療が行き届いているとは言えないため、もっと医療環境の充実を願っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あら、今日はどうしましたか？『朝から私を見ないと元気がでない』ですってー、もう！おじいちゃんったら」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67145"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c1079ff0f32996b36bf0e223472b6d9f632f30cc24218ced50937929713ccef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/494e1178bcee8160b756d58cb3eac68728f1f6b1e6eed7f8964c9cf20b679dad.webp","width":90,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西口有香","creatorId":"vndb:s24","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24","name":"西口 有香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:227352:67145:6592:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64638","characterName":"奥瀬 翔子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67146","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17496"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64638"},"originalCharacterName":"奥瀬 翔子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">Owner of a Sake Brewery"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The president of the small, but loved by drinkers all over the country, Okuse Brewery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Okuse Brewery has been in business since the Edo era, and while not very famous, it does have zealous fans that love it. Although her father was a great manager, he died early leaving Shouko - back then still a student - to succeed in haste and become the president."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ever since then, she has prioritized work before anything, seeking to make the best quality sake. With her serious and earnest personality, she follows through the things that she has once decided to do."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shouko wants to expand the brewery business not just within Japan, but all over the world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Iwamuro Village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64638"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小規模ながら、全国の酒好きにその名を知られた奥瀬醸造の女社長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"江戸時代創業の老舗の酒蔵で、有名とは言えないけれども、熱心なファンが付いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父はやり手の経営者だったのだが、早くに亡くなってしまい、当時まだ学生だった翔子が急きょ、父の跡を継いで社長になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以降、仕事最優先で最高の品質の日本酒づくりにすべてを捧げてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめで一途な性格で、一度決めた事は必ず最後まで貫き通そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親から受け継いだ日本酒を、全国はもちろん、世界にも拡げていきたいと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17496","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小規模ながら、全国の酒好きにその名を知られた奥瀬醸造の女社長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"江戸時代創業の老舗の酒蔵で、有名とは言えないけれども、熱心なファンが付いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父はやり手の経営者だったのだが、早くに亡くなってしまい、当時まだ学生だった翔子が急きょ、父の跡を継いで社長になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以降、仕事最優先で最高の品質の日本酒づくりにすべてを捧げてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめで一途な性格で、一度決めた事は必ず最後まで貫き通そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親から受け継いだ日本酒を、全国はもちろん、世界にも拡げていきたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「飲んでもらえれば、うちのお酒の良さはわかってもらえると思うんです。どうですか？　まずは一口だけでも」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67146"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f1affa0cb74dffa21ca473e6bb82d3999915b53d9929adb108e0441304721a59.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/66fa120450178e952eb6ec56736a8b04ac398c4d853f48283c89c6cb525198ca.webp","width":92,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤沢れい香","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:227352:67146:32998:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64639","characterName":"九條 恵那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67147","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17497"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64639"},"originalCharacterName":"九條 恵那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">University Student"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ena is a university student born in Umitsubame Town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ever since she was born, she has lived in Umitsubame and is very attached to it. She is very pained to see the town, which used to be so livid when she was young, slowly lose its life. Thinking of returning the town back to how it was, along with some other young people, she started activities to revive it. However, it didn't go well as planned and their activities were reaching a limit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she hears that a tourism consultant will come to the town to inspect it, she thought he might be the ideal person to pick up ideas from."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Umitsubame Town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64639"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元出身の女子大生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれた時から海燕町で過ごし、この町に深い愛着があり、子供の頃は賑やかだった町が、次第に寂れていく様を悲しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんとか昔の様に賑やかな町に戻せないかと考え、同じ志の若者たちと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"町おこしの活動を始めたが、なかなか思うように成果が出ず、自分たちの活動に限界を感じていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、観光コンサルタントが町を観察に来ると聞き、何か参考に出来るかもしれないと期待している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17497","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元出身の女子大生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれた時から海燕町で過ごし、この町に深い愛着があり、子供の頃は賑やかだった町が、次第に寂れていく様を悲しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんとか昔の様に賑やかな町に戻せないかと考え、同じ志の若者たちと町おこしの活動を始めたが、なかなか思うように成果が出ず、自分たちの活動に限界を感じていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、観光コンサルタントが町を視察に来ると聞き、何か参考に出来るかもしれないと期待している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私、この町をもっとみんなに知ってもらいたいんです！……でも何から始めたら良いのか」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67147"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df5cccb190876366a9e8990f09142299f2353bc82601f5eaeabf543e0a159da8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06dd456dd4db6c0b0e32c46d03c6e21f0aa6216f3351e0588db3a0411325843e.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"竹内仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s978","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s978","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s978","name":"羽鳥いち","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:227352:67147:15924:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64640","characterName":"一ノ宮 深花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67148","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17498"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64640"},"originalCharacterName":"一ノ宮 深花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">Miko"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A miko working at the shrine located in the old Umitsubame Town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she was young, she has been involved with many elderly people and has grown to have a very calm personality. She has a warm and fluffy aura around her and is liked by all the townspeople. As all the town residents have always been patrons of the shrine, she is very worried about the town's future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her gentle personality, she has a firm will and is ready to do anything for the sake of the shrine and the town as a miko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Umitsubame Town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64640"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧海燕町にある水鳥神社に仕える巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から年配の人と関わることが多く、その頃から落ち着いた性格をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわかゆったりした雰囲気をしていて、町の人たちから親しまれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々、この町の人たちは神社の氏子だったこともあり、この町の行く末について深く心を痛めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかな性格をしているけれども、芯はしっかりしていて、神社の為・町の為に、巫女として身を尽くす覚悟を持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17498","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧海燕町にある水鳥神社に仕える巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から年配の人と関わることが多く、その頃から落ち着いた性格をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわかゆったりした雰囲気をしていて、町の人たちから親しまれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々、この町の人たちは神社の氏子だったこともあり、この町の行く末について深く心を痛めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"緩やかな性格をしているけれども、芯はしっかりしていて、神社の為・町の為に、巫女として身を尽くす覚悟を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あなたのお仕事が滞りなく成し遂げられるよう、ご祈祷をさせて頂きましょう」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67148"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b129c8bfc550fda20029c0e5a2d882c0bff90f20e56198bbcf3907d36c505cb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c615fe14eea5b89225b661a60263d8572a4dbdac10144136abfbf8744498e630.webp","width":106,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:227352:67148:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64641","characterName":"玉井 梓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67149","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17499"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64641"},"originalCharacterName":"玉井 梓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">High school student"},{"spoiler":false,"text":">Helps at a cafe which is also a surf shop"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Azusa is a high school student who is lively on all occasions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has moved to the town from a big city along with her parents, who loves the sea."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents run a joint surfing shop with a cafe, to which she usually helps as a poster girl. She has a very bright personality and can get along well even with first time customers. Her hobby is surfing and she enjoys it anytime she doesn't have to help in the cafe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's hard to say that her family business is thriving, so she's thinking of a method to increase the number of tourists visiting. However, she's strongly against any heavy works by the seaside, afraid of sea pollution."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Umitsubame Town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64641"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも元気な明るい女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海が大好きな両親と共に都会から移住してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親は海のそばで、サーフィンショップを兼ねたカフェを経営していて、普段はそこの看板娘として手伝いをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい性格で、一見のお客さんともすぐ仲良くなれるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味はサーフィンで、朝夕などの仕事の無い時間はサーフィンを満喫している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店はけして繁盛しているとは言えないため、なんとか観光客を増やしたいと考えているものの、海岸の開発などで海が汚れたりするのは絶対に反対だと考えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17499","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも元気な明るい女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海が大好きな両親と共に都会から移住してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親は海のそばで、サーフショップを兼ねたカフェを経営していて、普段はそこの看板娘として手伝いをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい性格で、一見のお客さんともすぐ仲良くなれるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味はサーフィンで、朝夕などの仕事の無い時間はサーフィンを満喫している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ちょっと柔軟するから手伝って、お兄さん。　んっ……もっと強くしても大丈夫だよ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67149"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e507406bcc673b2df711b35afa0ce06900db5f852d0f95fa3450a565deb230e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63fe99728109ec759f1258d8003d276414fc29e1f967bd6d44bb3a49defbccf1.webp","width":156,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝井 こもも","creatorId":"vndb:s13810","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13810","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13810","name":"朝井こもも","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:75785","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64642","characterName":"堀 かなで","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"67150","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"227352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17500"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64642"},"originalCharacterName":"堀 かなで","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":">High School Student"},{"spoiler":false,"text":">Temporary Radio Personality"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high school student whose hobby is listening to radio."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rather than play with her friends, Kanade prefers to listen to radio all alone. One day, when the local radio station was looking for volunteers, she applied and was accepted. At first she was just helping out with miscellaneous chores in the station after school, but when the main personality suddenly quit on short notice, she had to pick up the role of a radio personality herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kanade has a reserved personality and doesn't like standing out. Despite her being very timid, she does her best at everything she tries and fulfills her duties well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a resident of Umitsubame Town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64642"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ラジオを聴くのが趣味の女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達と賑やかに遊ぶ事よりも、1人でラジオを聞くほうが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある時、地元のコミュニティFM局でボランティアの募集があり、応募したところ受かってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初はお手伝いとして、放課後に雑用をこなしたりしていたが、看板のパーソナリティが突然に辞めてしまい、急遽かなでにパーソナリティの仕事が回ってきてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案な性格で、目立つのは得意では無いタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おどおどした雰囲気をしているけれども、何事も一生懸命で、自分がするべき事はしっかりと成し遂げようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17500","sourceWorkId":"25907","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ラジオを聴くのが趣味の女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達と賑やかに遊ぶ事よりも、1人でラジオを聴くほうが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある時、地元のコミュニティFM局でボランティアの募集があり、応募したところ受かってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初はお手伝いとして、放課後に雑用をこなしたりしていたが、看板のパーソナリティが突然に辞めてしまい、急遽かなでにパーソナリティの仕事が回ってきてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案な性格で、目立つのは得意では無いタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おどおどした雰囲気をしているけれども、何事も一生懸命で、自分がするべき事はしっかりと成し遂げようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今日から、かなでがパーソナリティ……？えぇぇぇー、そんなこと絶対無理ですよぅ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67150"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa36336fbcc152a5917a3c583d7d5fc9284f33d41f72095c4aa5c2e18e16c031.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date